        "divine"
      ],
      "entries": [
        "A wyrmwraith's claws rend divine magic. Whenever a wyrmwraith hits a creature with a spectral claw Strike|PC1, the wyrmwraith can attempt a Religion|PC1 check to counteract an ongoing divine|PC1 spell effect on the creature."
